OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F438A1786744259
OL,3,CWales Captain Aaron Ramsey announces
OL,4,Cretirement from football
OL,6,FHe made a return to the national side
OL,7,Ftowards the end of last year after
OL,8,Finjury ruled him out for more than 12
OL,9,Fmonths.
OL,11,FSpeaking to ITV Cymru Wales, former
OL,12,FCardiff City and Wales international
OL,13,Ffootballer Rob Earnshaw described
OL,14,FRamsey as an "amazing human being" who
OL,15,Fwas "always ready to look after his
OL,16,Fteammates".
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
