OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F438A1786744259
OL,3,CWales Captain Aaron Ramsey announces
OL,4,Cretirement from football
OL,6,F"The best way to leave is on your own
OL,7,Fterms and I think maybe right now is
OL,8,Fthe right time for Aaron Ramsey to
OL,9,Fleave because it's on his own terms,"
OL,10,Fhe said of Ramsey's retirement.
OL,12,FSpeaking of Ramsey as a player, he
OL,13,Fadded: "He made my job easier because
OL,14,Fof how good he was - because of his
OL,15,Fquality and his vision, awareness, and
OL,16,Fcreativity and all of those beautiful
OL,17,Fthings we've seen on the football
OL,18,Fpitch."
