OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F438A1786744259
OL,3,CWales Captain Aaron Ramsey announces
OL,4,Cretirement from football
OL,6,FWhen asked about what lays ahead for
OL,7,Fthe former Wales Captain, Earnshaw
OL,8,Fsaid: "I would imagine he wants to go
OL,9,Finto coaching. I know he's mentioned
OL,10,Fcoaching before and managing, so I
OL,11,Fimagine that's next for Aaron Ramsey.
OL,13,F"He's going to have to spend a few
OL,14,Fyears and be that young player again:
OL,15,Fexcept you're going to be a young
OL,16,Fcoach, trying to learn, trying to
OL,17,Fdevelop your talent but he's
OL,18,Fdefinitely got it in him."
OL,26,@pD@GOUuD@AOUzD@ZO]
