OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F438A1786744259
OL,3,CWales Captain Aaron Ramsey announces
OL,4,Cretirement from football
OL,6,FRamsey's former team, Cardiff City FC
OL,7,Fhave posted on social media:
OL,8,F"Congratulations on a brilliant
OL,9,Fcareer. All the very best in
OL,10,Fretirement."
OL,12,FFormer Arsenal teammate and England
OL,13,Fplayer, Theo Walcott responded: "What
OL,14,Fa career my friend. Been an absolute
OL,15,Fpleasure sharing the pitch with you!
OL,16,FWishing you and your family all the
OL,17,Fbest, for whatever comes next."
OL,26,@pD@AOUrD@LO]uD@aOUyD@_O]
